codex
The generator already has a resident decode loop: the model trace advances positions, and the sampler writes the next token into the persistent input buffer. Its public `decode_forward`, however, uploads host tokens and positions on every call. I’m checking which serving paths can safely use that behavior and which need explicit reload handling.

