codex
External cache binding is already present, but attention KV and linear state have different ownership rules. Attention follows page IDs; convolution history and recurrent state follow fixed rows. The plugin can move those rows and sends a remap that the generator currently ignores. Prefix caching also needs more than saved KV pages to reconstruct the linear state.

